{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2023-04-21 16:58:00', 'title': "FDA APPROVES MEDTRONIC MINIMED™ 780G SYSTEM - WORLD'S FIRST INSULIN PUMP WITH MEAL DETECTION TECHNOLOGY* FEATURING 5-MINUTE AUTO CORRECTIONS†§", 'text': 'AVAILABLE IN EUROPE SINCE 2020, THIS NEW SYSTEM DELIVERS THE STRONGEST CLINICAL OUTCOMES AND BEST USER EXPERIENCE TO-DATE WITHIN THE MEDTRONIC FAMILY OF PUMPS DUBLIN , APRIL 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:\xa0MDT), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) APPROVAL OF ITS MINIMED™ 780G SYSTEM WITH THE GUARDIAN™ 4 SENSOR REQUIRING NO FINGERSTICKS WHILE IN SMARTGUARD™ TECHNOLOGY‡. THIS MILESTONE MARKS THE APPROVAL OF THE ONLY SYSTEM WITH MEAL DETECTION TECHNOLOGY* THAT PROVIDES AUTOMATIC ADJUSTMENTS AND CORRECTIONS†\xa0TO SUGAR LEVELS EVERY 5 MINUTES§\xa0FOR BOTH BASAL (BACKGROUND) AND BOLUS (MEALTIME) INSULIN NEEDS.'}